      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The following code shows a custom shader that renders particles with a radial gradient.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet emitter = SKEmitterNode()\n    \nlet radialGradientShader = SKShader(source: \"void main() {\" +\n    \"    vec2 coord = (v_tex_coord - 0.5) * 2.0;\" +\n    \"    gl_FragColor = vec4(1.0 - length(coord));\" +\n    \"}\")  \n      \nemitter.shader = radialGradientShader\n```",
      "documentTitle": "Getting Started with Particle Shaders",
      "framework": "SpriteKit",
